+    <string name="victor_l10n_settings_surfaces_your_strap_s_nightly_spo_estimate" formatted="false">Surfaces your strap\'s nightly SpO₂ estimate in the Blood Oxygen tile when no calibrated percentage is available: a WHOOP 5.0/MG\'s @82 candidate byte, or an Oura ring\'s own reading with each sample capped at 100\u0025 first (the ring\'s raw reading runs high otherwise). This is an UNVERIFIED strap-computed value — the WHOOP candidate matched a reference device closely on most nights but moved opposite on some; the Oura one has only been checked against a few nights so far. Shown as an \'estimate\' and never fed into recovery or illness scoring. Off by default.</string>
