+    <string name="victor_l10n_settings_earliest_wake_time">Earliest wake time</string>
+    <string name="victor_l10n_settings_also_arms_your_to_buzz_at_your_earliest">Also arms your %1$s to buzz at your earliest wake time, so the strap wakes you first and the phone alarm is the guaranteed backup.</string>
+    <string name="victor_l10n_settings_connect_your_strap_to_use_this_it_arms_the">Connect your strap to use this. It arms the strap to buzz at your earliest wake time as a gentler first wake-up.</string>
