+    <string name="victor_l10n_settings_arms_the_strap_to_buzz_at_your_wake_time">Arms the strap to buzz at your wake time, even if NOOP is closed. Sends the exact alarm command the official app sends, confirmed buzzing on a real WHOOP 4.0 (community wire capture + on-device test, #535). Keep a backup alarm for anything you truly can\'t miss.</string>
