+    <string name="victor_l10n_settings_connect_your_strap_to_arm_this_it_s_set_on">Connect your strap to arm this; it\'s set on the strap\'s own firmware alarm. Confirmed working on WHOOP 4.0; still experimental on 5.0 and MG. Keep a backup alarm for anything you truly can\'t miss.</string>
+    <string name="victor_l10n_settings_armed_on_the_strap_itself_so_it_can_buzz">Armed on the strap itself, so it can buzz at your wake time even if your phone is asleep or NOOP is closed. Sends the exact alarm command the official app sends, confirmed buzzing on a real WHOOP 4.0 (community wire capture + on-device test, #535). Keep a backup alarm for anything you truly can\'t miss.</string>
